# Anchor: post-P1.5-5 output of rednoteTools.js. Same stacking pattern --
# inserts a new try/catch before the closing `});` of addInitScript.
#
# Red lines: No fetch/XHR/cookie overrides. No speechSynthesis.speak override
# (read-only voices list is sufficient). Synchronous replacement is correct:
# bot probes call getVoices() expecting a pre-loaded list.
#
